            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Merck Childhood Asthma Network, Inc conference titled &quot;State of Childhood Asthma and Future Directions: Strategies for Implementing Best Practices&quot; was held December 13 to 14, 2006. Here we summarize the presentations and recommendations for systems approaches from that conference and discuss current asthma care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
